      "statement": "A gadget's UI is rendered from the UiBundle's jsCode inside an iframe with srcDoc, sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" and no allow-same-origin, wrapped in a document whose CSP sets default-src 'none' and connect-src 'none' so gadget code cannot make network requests.",
