      "statement": "Cap'n Web is injected into the sandboxed gadget iframe as a doubly-nested data URL (the outer script is a data URL importing capnweb from an inner base64 data:text/javascript URL); the injected prefix also monkey-patches console to forward logs to the parent, blocks window.open (only user-activated target=_blank links survive, hardened with noopener), forwards Escape keydowns, and captures uncaught errors and unhandled rejections as console messages.",
