      "id": "claim_9f861109ffa4436990476f12d421e143",
      "statement": "The gadget iframe handshake is accepted only when event.source is the parent's own iframe contentWindow and event.origin is the string \"null\"; on handshake the parent fetches the gadget's server-side stub via GadgetClient.connectToGadget and opens the MessagePort RPC session against a forwarding Proxy RpcTarget that resolves methods against the current stub or defers calls onto a pending promise during reconnection, so top-level calls survive stub swaps without reloading the frame.",
